  "description": "Lee Yeon-Woo, taking his fourth civil service exam, barely survives the Human Qualification Test that turns humans into beasts and receives a job offer from a suspicious company called the ‘Human Protection Corporation’. Can Yeon-Woo, as an investigator for the Anomaly Investigation Team of the Human Protection Company, which isolates, secures, and studies anomalies to protect humanity, protect the human world and survive to the end?\n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)",
